💡 Patterns to Remember:

Two pointers from start & end → max/min problems, container, trapping water

Two pointers for sorted array → sum, difference, pair problems

Two pointers + sliding window → substring, subarray, unique characters

Three pointers / multiple pointers → 3Sum, 3Sum closest

In-place swap → partitioning arrays or strings
